  "description": "StateSync replication adapter for SetNet.Mobs: an IMobReplication that registers a mob archetype (interpolated position, velocity, health, target hash, cast id + remaining) and spawns/mutates/despawns a SetNet.StateSync NetworkEntity per mob, so nearby players observe mobs through the same delta-compressed snapshot stream as everything else. One-line wiring via world.StateSyncReplication() / mobServer.UseStateSyncReplication(world). Depends on SetNet.Mobs + SetNet.StateSync.",
